      "userJourney": "(1) KYB - Legal Entity Identification and info\n- A Bosch Representative presents their personal PID via EUDI Wallet to Bundesanzeiger Business Wallet (Spherity).\n- Bundesanzeiger issues the EU Business Wallet Owner Identification Data (EBWOID) \nand EU Company Credential (EUCC) attestations directly to the Bosch Business Wallet (Procivis).\n\n(2) KYC & Financial Onboarding\n- Bosch presents its attestation (EBWOID, EUCC) alongside multi-source attestations (Ownership, VAT, UBO, etc.) \nto the Deutsche Bank Business Wallet (Procivis) .\n- The Ultimate Beneficial Owner's (UBO) identity is verified via their personal EUDI Wallet.\n- The corporate account contract is created and signed (skipped by demo).\n- Deutsche Bank issues an IBAN Owner (IBAN-OV) Attestation directly to the Bosch Business Wallet.\n\n(3) KYS & Invoice Issuing\n- The supplier, SBB presents its corporate credentials (EBWOID, EUCC, VAT, etc.) for instant, automated KYS onboarding at Bosch.\n- Additionally, SBB’s commercial Payment Terms and bank-issued IBAN-OV attestations are presented to secure the payment triggering.\n- SBB delivers the ordered parts and issues a cryptographically signed eInvoice  to the Bosch Business Wallet&",
